Simple python FastAPI installation to test FastAPI and fastapi CLI in local.

Steps:

1. Clone this repo by
    git clone https://github.com/coderndecoder/PythonAPIs.git

2. Create virtual environment inside the project SimpleFastAPIs
    python3 -m venv .venv

3. Activate the virtual environment
    source .venv/bin/activate

4. Install FastAPI CLI packages to run it locally
    pip3 install "fastapi[standard]"

5. Test installation 
    fastapi -h

6. Run the fastapi in dev mode
    fastapi dev

7. Server will be started, this the first test for "Hello World". Open below URLs in browser.
    http://127.0.0.1:8000
    http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs#/

8. Test the other servcie function with parameters 
    http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/4?q=somequery

9. 